&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="font-claude-response-body"&gt;You'll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="font-claude-response-body"&gt; help build and execute integrated marketing plans that resonate with Central European consumers, support commercial goals, and strengthen our presence in the region. Working cross-functionally with local sales teams, the social marketing team, trade marketing, PR, and the wider global marketing team, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="font-claude-response-body"&gt;you'll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="font-claude-response-body"&gt; bring insight, creativity, and precision to the day-to-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="font-claude-response-body"&gt;day of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="font-claude-response-body"&gt; driving performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
